{
 "info": {
  "_postman_id": "or-self-filter-inside-retention-2026-11-25",
  "name": "OpenRegister Self Filter Inside Retention",
  "description": "A list filtered on a field inside the retention block (change self-filter-inside-retention, task 1.4).\n\nWHAT IT ASSERTS: three dossiers dated from their closing date (five years ago, two years ago, three years ahead, bewaartermijn P1Y) carry an archiefactiedatum; `@self[retention.archiefactiedatum][lt]=<today>` and the nested spelling `@self_retention_archiefactiedatum[lt]=<today>` both return exactly the two past their date; `[gte]=<today>` returns exactly the third (CONTROL).\n\nHermetic: it creates its schema, register and dossiers, and removes them.",
  "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
 },
 "auth": {
  "type": "basic",
  "basic": [
